                    "richTextValue": "<!-- \"Not sure which account?\" FAQ help prompt for Experience Cloud.\n     Inline styles only — no <style>, classes, pseudo-elements, or scripts.\n     Change href=\"/consumer/s/knowledge\" to your FAQ / topic-catalog page. -->\n<div style=\"background:#F1ECF8;border-radius:14px;padding:44px;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#4B286D;\">\n  <div style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#4B286D;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6C3F9E,#4B286D);color:#ffffff;font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:700;line-height:56px;text-align:center;margin:0 auto 18px;\">?</div>\n  <p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 10px;color:#4B286D;\">Not sure what account is right for you?</p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.5;color:#3a4451;max-width:520px;margin:0 auto 26px;\">Look at our specially curated FAQs about all of our products.</p>\n  <a href=\"/consumer/s/knowledge\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#4B286D;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:9px;\">Explore our FAQs &rarr;</a>\n</div>"
